[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17102.11, "timestamp": "04:45:02", "text": "就是要放类似这样的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17104.27, "timestamp": "04:45:04", "text": "好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17107.43, "timestamp": "04:45:07", "text": "钢铁侠之类的。你觉得某人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17114.47, "timestamp": "04:45:14", "text": "它？不。好的。好的。好的。好的。等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17117.19, "timestamp": "04:45:17", "text": "如果我输入“动漫”呢？好的。不，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17125.99, "timestamp": "04:45:25", "text": "嗯，只需要一点想象力就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17127.75, "timestamp": "04:45:27", "text": "耐心去弄明白。我挣扎了很久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17129.27, "timestamp": "04:45:29", "text": "之前和编辑沟通过，我不得不问他。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17130.868, "timestamp": "04:45:30", "text": "寻求帮助，他们也乐意帮忙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17133.708, "timestamp": "04:45:33", "text": "这是一个很好的社区。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17136.788, "timestamp": "04:45:36", "text": "哦。是啊，看起来好像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17139.31, "timestamp": "04:45:39", "text": "这些有趣的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17142.55, "timestamp": "04:45:42", "text": "人类创造。那本身就是如此"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17144.39, "timestamp": "04:45:44", "text": "凉爽的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17148.03, "timestamp": "04:45:48", "text": "这家伙认识你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17156.75, "timestamp": "04:45:56", "text": "[音乐]"}]